msgid "Enable Basic authentication"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Enable Basic authentication to require a username and password before users "
"can access your Quarkus application.\n"
"For more information, see xref:security-basic-authentication.adoc[Basic "
"authentication]."
msgstr ""

msgid "Prerequisites"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You have installed at least one extension that provides an "
"`IdentityProvider` to verify username and password credentials and map them "
"to a `SecurityIdentity`.\n"
"For example:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"xref:security-jpa.adoc[Quarkus Security Jakarta Persistence extensions "
"(`quarkus-security-jpa` or `quarkus-security-jpa-reactive`)]"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"xref:security-properties.adoc[Elytron security properties file extension "
"`(quarkus-elytron-security-properties-file)`]"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"xref:security-jdbc.adoc[Elytron security JDBC extension `(quarkus-elytron-"
"security-jdbc)`]"
msgstr ""

msgid "Procedure"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"In the `application.properties` file, set the `quarkus.http.auth.basic` "
"property to `true`."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Configure an identity provider to verify the username and password against "
"your user store.\n"
"For a production application, configure one of the identity provider "
"extensions listed in the Prerequisites, for example, by storing users in a "
"database with the Jakarta Persistence extension.\n"
"For more information, see the xref:security-identity-providers.adoc[Identity "
"providers] guide."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"*For testing only:* In a non-production environment, you can use the "
"embedded realm provided by the `quarkus-elytron-security-properties-file` "
"extension instead of a production identity provider."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"To enable authentication for the embedded realm, set the `quarkus.security."
"users.embedded.enabled` property to `true`."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"You can also configure the required user credentials: user name, password, "
"and roles.\n"
"For example:"
msgstr ""

msgid "where:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The user, `alice`, has `alice` as their password and `admin` as their role."
msgstr ""

msgid "The user, `bob`, has `bob` as their password and `user` as their role."
msgstr ""

msgid "Verification"
msgstr ""

msgid "Start your application."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Send a request to a secured endpoint _without_ credentials and confirm that "
"the application returns a `401 Unauthorized` response:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Send the same request _with_ a valid username and password and confirm that "
"the application returns a `200 OK` response:"
msgstr ""

msgid "Next steps"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"For a more detailed walk-through that shows you how to configure Basic "
"authentication together with Jakarta Persistence for storing user "
"credentials in a database, see the xref:security-getting-started-tutorial."
"adoc[Getting started with Security by using Basic authentication and Jakarta "
"Persistence] guide."
msgstr ""

